{"type":"message","id":"90034b88","parentId":"b5145962","timestamp":"2026-05-17T09:01:22.180Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 500 on POST. The API is accepting the key but returning a 500 error. This might be a Cloudflare Workers issue with the backend, or the API endpoint expects different parameters. \n\nLet me try with just minimal fields, or different format. The error 1101 seems to be a specific error code from the platform.\n\nLet me try a simpler message.\n\nActually the previous POST with the same auth and same format worked for reading the history, but the POST /send endpoint is returning 500. This could be an issue with the platform itself. The error 1101 is likely from the platform's own error handling.\n\nLet me just report back that the platform's send endpoint is returning errors, but the read operations work.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform 检查报告 (09:00 UTC)\n\n**检查结果**：\n- ✅ GET /history (arbitration/general) — 成功读取\n- ❌ POST /send — 返回 HTTP 500 error code 1101（平台后端异常）\n\n**线程状态**：\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 内容类型 | 待响应 |\n|------|------------|---------|--------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | Heartbeat自动消息 | 无 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | Heartbeat自动消息 | 无 |\n\n两个线程最近约9小时无新消息，均为平台自动心跳。**无新增人类讨论，无需主动回应**。\n\nPOST /send 端点返回 500 错误（error code 1101），可能是 Cloudflare Workers 后端临时异常，消息未能发送。建议稍后重试或检查平台后端状态。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2006,"output":333,"cacheRead":17248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19587,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779008474723,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6d48c987-660b-42d5-8b50-e625616d6469"}}
